  "title": "Citi and Credendo Close $328M Aviation Deal for IndiGo Jets",
  "summary": "Citi and Credendo announced a $328 million aviation financing deal for IndiGo to acquire eight Airbus A321 and A320 aircraft, marking the first ECA-backed aircraft financing through a GIFT IFSC structure. The transaction, backed by Credendo's credit insurance, will support Indigo's fleet and network growth.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Citi, Credendo, and Indigo signed a $328 million aviation financing deal for eight Airbus A321 and A320 aircraft.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The transaction was executed through Indigo's subsidiary, InterGlobe Aviation Financial Services IFSC, with Citi acting as the sole mandated arranger and ECA coordinator.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The financing is the first ECA-backed aircraft financing in the aviation industry, structured under GIFT IFSC.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
